  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🆕 Additions\n- Implemented process suspend and resume support via `ProcessWrapper`.\n- Added support for `FireAndForget` execution in `ExternalProcess`.\n#### 🗑️ Removals\n- Removed `BasicFilePathResolver.cs`.\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Aligned `ExternalProcess` disposal logic with official documentation.\n- Fixed an issue where Standard Input was inadvertently redirected.\n- Simplified calls to the file path resolver.\n- Updated `ProcessInvoker` and `ExternalProcess` internal logic for stability.\n- Updated DotExtensions version from 10.3.0 to 10.3.2",
